message: "If you cite or build on Turnfile, cite the specification repository."
title: "Turnfile: Structured Negotiation of Autonomous Peers (SNAP)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-07-02
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rogers
    given-names: Sam
url: "https://turnfile.work/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/snapsynapse/turnfile"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
