abstract: "Turnfile is a file-based governance protocol for multi-agent work: independent agent positions, preserved dissent, maintainer-governed resolution and plain-file audit, with no orchestrator. v1.0.0 (the Minimal Governance Profile) is a stable specification in maintenance-only mode. Code is Apache-2.0; specification and documentation prose is CC BY 4.0."
keywords:
  - multi-agent
  - governance
  - LLM agents
  - decision records
  - human arbitration
